<section><h2>Copyright and changes</h2><p>Site text, original illustrations, and design are protected by applicable copyright or license terms. Trademarks belong to their owners. We may update the site and these terms; the date above identifies this version.</p></section>
<section><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions, permissions, or notices may be sent to <a href="mailto:editor@securebyteguide.org">editor@securebyteguide.org</a>.</p></section></div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
